<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Then little Jamal came out as dark as dragon's scale!
<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: It's PROOF! he's yours!
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I was being POETIC, you absolute turnip!
<<Act Jamal jamalChill 0.8 0.1 #505050>>
Jamal: Ma', why is pa-pa so pale? He sick or something?
<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: He's just confused, honey-muffin. He left to get milk seven years ago and forgot where the store was.

<<Act Jamal jamalTalk 0.8 0.2 #505050>>
Jamal: Seven years? Damn. That's a looot of milk.
Jamal: Can I have some now cuh?
<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I was NOT getting milk! I was on DIPLOMATIC BUSINESS!

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
